Package: gasexchangeR
Type: Package
Title: Processing and Fitting of Leaf Gas Exchange Curves
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Camille K. Sicangco
Maintainer: <c.sicangco@westernsydney.edu.au>
Description: Shared functions for adding/mapping species codes and fitting
    A-Ci and temperature-response (Vcmax, Jmax, respiration) curves,
    extracted for reuse across multiple field study projects. Provides
    A-Ci curve fitting with either the plantecophys or PhotoGEA packages,
    and fitting of Arrhenius-type temperature responses to derived
    photosynthetic parameters.
Imports:
    dplyr,
    rlang,
    stringr,
    nlme,
    lme4,
    plantecophys,
    PhotoGEA,
    lattice,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
